{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been crushed under this brutal regime for far too long.<br>Come - it\u2019s time to let them have a taste of their own destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296470/extras/MetalGenesis_GIF_CBach_Phase_02_Compressed.gif?t=1746409757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Mech Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a rebel leader controlling a squad of three mechs, each with a different arsenal. Swap between mechs mid-combat and use their unique strengths tactically to overcome your foes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296470/extras/MetalGenesis_GIF_CBach_Entrance_03_Compressed.gif?t=1746409757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down gargantuan mech bosses in a series of action-packed battles! Understand the enemy, execute evasive maneuvers, and exploit every weakness you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296470/extras/MetalGenesis_GIF_CBach_Gattai_02_Compressed.gif?t=1746409757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ultimate Fusion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine your mechs through the power of Gattai! Together, you\u2019re unstoppable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Assets may not be representative of the final product.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Trailer BGM Credit</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Gothamlicious&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kevin MacLeod </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attri